  << /ActualText (My time at Inditex was divided into two distinct phases\054 both focused on Design Systems but applied to different products\072\050\nSewing DS\072 Collaborated on the maintenance and scalability of Inditex\047s internal Design System\056 Led cross\055functional ceremonies with development teams and design verticals to ensure consistency\054 adoption\054 and system evolution across internal tools\056\050\nMultitenant DS\072 Spearheaded the creation of a multi\055brand Design System to unify the digital presence of all Inditex e\055commerce brands while preserving individual brand identities\056 Managed the full lifecycle \024 from defining design tokens and building scalable components to overseeing handoff and integration with development teams\056)
